{"unit_id":"quaner1234-cmd__dsh-subagent-watchdog#card-zh","repo":"quaner1234-cmd/dsh-subagent-watchdog","commit":"37c1da0275ecab1dc2818cd624fe2c8255df0ebc","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-subagent-watchdog 是 DSH 的后台子 agent 恢复插件。可续接的子 agent 因 max-tokens 结束时，它等待会话持久化后，通过 subagents.followup 续接同一子会话一次。插件检查子 agent 模式和已有续接标记，避免重复续接；若恢复后再次失败，则通知父会话一次。适合使用 DSH 原生 continuable 子 agent、希望减少 token 上限中断后手动续接的用户。仅处理 continuable 子 agent；无需额外 API key 或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:257","lib/index.js:314","lib/index.js:415","lib/index.js:459","lib/index.js:480","lib/index.js:509"]}
{"unit_id":"quaner1234-cmd__dsh-subagent-watchdog#card-en","repo":"quaner1234-cmd/dsh-subagent-watchdog","commit":"37c1da0275ecab1dc2818cd624fe2c8255df0ebc","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-subagent-watchdog resumes a DSH continuable child once after max-tokens, waiting for persistence before calling subagents.followup. A durable marker prevents duplicate recovery. If the resumed task fails again, it sends one notice to the parent. No extra API key or service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:257","lib/index.js:314","lib/index.js:415","lib/index.js:459","lib/index.js:480","lib/index.js:509"]}
