{"unit_id":"quaner1234-cmd__dsh-subagent-watchdog#intent-5","repo":"quaner1234-cmd/dsh-subagent-watchdog","commit":"37c1da0275ecab1dc2818cd624fe2c8255df0ebc","type":"intent","lang":"en","text":"Can a DSH child agent resume once when it runs out of output tokens?","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:453","lib/index.js:509"]}
{"unit_id":"quaner1234-cmd__dsh-subagent-watchdog#intent-6","repo":"quaner1234-cmd/dsh-subagent-watchdog","commit":"37c1da0275ecab1dc2818cd624fe2c8255df0ebc","type":"intent","lang":"en","text":"Automatically continue the same subagent conversation after a max-tokens stop.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:510","lib/index.js:512"]}
{"unit_id":"quaner1234-cmd__dsh-subagent-watchdog#feature-1","repo":"quaner1234-cmd/dsh-subagent-watchdog","commit":"37c1da0275ecab1dc2818cd624fe2c8255df0ebc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-subagent-watchdog 的功能「自动续接子 agent」：当可续接子 agent 的回合以 max-tokens 结束时，插件等待会话持久化检查完成，再向同一子会话发送一次继续任务的指令。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:350","lib/index.js:415","lib/index.js:459","lib/index.js:509"]}
{"unit_id":"quaner1234-cmd__dsh-subagent-watchdog#feature-2","repo":"quaner1234-cmd/dsh-subagent-watchdog","commit":"37c1da0275ecab1dc2818cd624fe2c8255df0ebc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-subagent-watchdog 的功能「恢复失败通知」：如果自动续接后的子 agent 再次以 max-tokens 或明确错误结束，插件向委派任务的父会话发送一次失败说明，不再自动尝试。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:442","lib/index.js:446"]}
{"unit_id":"quaner1234-cmd__dsh-subagent-watchdog#feature-3","repo":"quaner1234-cmd/dsh-subagent-watchdog","commit":"37c1da0275ecab1dc2818cd624fe2c8255df0ebc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-subagent-watchdog 的功能「避免重复续接」：插件读取子会话中的续接标记；若已有 watchdog 续接记录，就将该任务视为已续接，避免重启后再次发送自动续接。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:402","lib/index.js:407","lib/index.js:492"]}
{"unit_id":"quaner1234-cmd__dsh-subagent-watchdog#caveat-1","repo":"quaner1234-cmd/dsh-subagent-watchdog","commit":"37c1da0275ecab1dc2818cd624fe2c8255df0ebc","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-subagent-watchdog 仅对模式已确认的 continuable 子 agent 处理首次 max-tokens 终止；one-shot 子 agent 和首次以明确错误结束的任务不会自动续接。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:425","lib/index.js:450","lib/index.js:453","lib/index.js:485"]}
